  "body": "## Scope\nStart the user-requested source-to-code implementation following the R1/R2/R3 and final engineering review. This is a bounded, additive **implementation-preflight increment**, not completion of the 25-strategy campaign.\n\nBase: `101fe5ff8fe181477489758e098243fd4a87890c`\nHead: `8fc90128200843c2f32413427538ec84ebc0593e`\n\n## Actual changes\n- Per-rule provenance fields and digest: source-direct / existing-frozen / declared-hypothesis are separate. This validates record shape, not the truth of source claims.\n- A single-detail-bar entry witness for next-open / stop-market / limit orders. Activation/expiry ambiguity and same-bar entry-stop ambiguity are retained; limit touch never fabricates a maker fill. This is **not** a complete subbar replay or an observed execution ledger.\n- Synchronized linear USDT-M account-snapshot valuation using actual residual quantity, realized gross, cumulative fees and signed funding. MARK/LAST are explicit; absent data remains unavailable. No leverage multiplier is reapplied. External cash flows and liquidation simulation are unsupported.\n- Exact original-25 roster coverage plus reference-only code paths, and an actionable continuation file.\n\n## Executed verification\n- 58 new synthetic tests.\n- All Scalp7 tests: **1001 passed**.\n- black / ruff / mypy / frozen Exact25 source checks: PASS.\n- 7 saved-publication checks: PASS, including preserved PR1340/1341 artifacts. No historical replay in these checks.\n- Receipt and test logs: `research/campaigns/scalp7_20260920/implementation_preflight_v1/`.\n\n## Preserved boundaries / still to do\n- Existing frozen execution_v2, metrics_v2, campaign_v2 and strategy implementations unchanged.\n- New helpers are **not yet wired into the existing campaign**. Actual source-expression-caller bindings, stateful replay and real snapshot adapters remain subsequent work.\n- The 25-row path list is a text-match index, not 25 completed source reproductions.\n- **New economics 0; new source reproductions 0; adoptions 0; service changes 0.** Previous PR1341 budget is exhausted (4/4 completed); this PR grants no new FULL allocation.\n- No Work UI session launched, no deployment, no live/order authority, no promotion.\n\n## Rollback\nAdditive research files only. Revert this commit to remove this increment; no production consumer has been switched.",
